            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Mosaic 2.1</h2>
<p>Mosaic can now download and install updates automatically when you quit. Enable automatic updates in Settings, or choose Check for Updates to install and relaunch immediately.</p>
<p>This release requires one manual installation for users upgrading from Mosaic 2.0.2 or earlier. Accounts, sessions, layouts, and preferences are preserved.</p>
]]></description>
